LORD our God.","poem":1},{"text":"Worship at his footstool.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"He is Holy!","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Moses and Aaron were amongst his priests,","poem":1},{"text":"Samuel was amongst those who call on his name.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"They called on the LORD, and he answered them.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"He spoke to them in the pillar of cloud.","poem":1},{"text":"They kept his testimonies,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"the statute that he gave them.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"You answered them, LORD our God.","poem":1},{"text":"You are a God who forgave them,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"although you took vengeance for their doings.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Exalt the LORD, our God.","poem":1},{"text":"Worship at his holy hill,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"for the LORD, our God, is holy!","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_weu/PSA/99.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_weu/PSA/100.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_weu/PSA/98.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}